   "t": "英語。",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": ". Putting the respectful prefix in front of ",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "muranishi",
   "t": "好き。",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": ", liked or fond of, turns 'do you like' into polite customer-service speech.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
